# shapez2Solver Architecture

## App ownership

| Layer | Path | Owner | Responsibility |
|---|---|---|---|
| shapez_core | `django_apps/shapez_core/` | 도미닉 | shape rules, parsing, normalization, preview serialization |
| shapez_solver | `django_apps/shapez_solver/` | 유리 | solver use cases, planner/solver services, persisted solver runs |
| web | `django_apps/web/` | 지나 | page composition, templates, static assets, thin view controllers |
| tests | `tests/` | 테스 | unit and integration coverage |

## Dependency direction

- `shapez_core` imports no `web` and no `shapez_solver`.
- `shapez_solver` may import `shapez_core`.
- `web` may import `shapez_core` and `shapez_solver`.
- HTTP endpoints belong to the app that owns the behavior, not to a generic API hub.

Allowed:

- `django_apps.shapez_solver -> django_apps.shapez_core`
- `django_apps.web -> django_apps.shapez_core`
- `django_apps.web -> django_apps.shapez_solver`

Forbidden:

- `django_apps.shapez_core -> django_apps.web`
- `django_apps.shapez_core -> django_apps.shapez_solver`
- `django_apps.shapez_solver -> django_apps.web`

## Placement rules

- Core domain objects and canonical shape data stay in `django_apps/shapez_core/domain/`.
- Parsing and preview response composition stay in `django_apps/shapez_core/services/`.
- Solver persistence and orchestration stay in `django_apps/shapez_solver/`.
- HTML rendering and browser assets stay in `django_apps/web/`.

## Test placement

- Core parsing/rendering logic: `tests/unit/shapez_core/`
- Solver logic and models: `tests/unit/shapez_solver/`
- Request/response and page smoke tests: `tests/integration/`

경로가 곧 pytest 마커(`unit`/`integration`, 앱별 마커)와 대응한다. 구간만 돌리는 방법은 [AGENTS.md](mdc:AGENTS.md) **테스트 구간 실행 (pytest 마커)**.

